.SS "gboolean gevas_exposed (GtkWidget * widget, GdkEventExpose * ev, gpointer data)"
.PP
callback: window was (partially?) obscured before, exposed now. 
.PP
I'm gevas exposed callback. Without me, gevas would have no scrollbar. 
.PP
