.RS 4
FALSE so further handlers can be processed 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIwidget\fP the gevas 
.br
\fIev\fP the expose-event 
.br
\fIdata\fP the icon-list shown in this window
.RE
.PP

